+Converting data while inserting
+--------------------------------
+
+The ``--convert`` option runs Python code against every incoming JSON object before
+it is inserted. The object is available as ``row`` and can be modified in place.
+Every incoming object will still be inserted. For example::
+
+    $ printf '{"n": "1"}\n{"n": "2"}\n' \
+        | sqlite-utils insert numbers.db numbers - --nl \
+            --convert 'row["n"] = int(row["n"]) + 1'
+
